#: forms_config.py
msgid "PAP minimum time and PAP characters per player apply to fleets that start after a change; running and closed fleets keep the values they started with. PAP multiplier mode and PAP multiplier tiers are read when a fleet ends, so the settings at that moment apply."
msgstr "「PAP 最低在队时长」和「每位玩家的 PAP 角色数」只对修改之后开启的舰队生效，进行中和已结束的舰队沿用开舰队时的数值；「PAP 倍率模式」和「PAP 倍率」在舰队结束时按当时的设置计算。"

