msgstr "SRP 提供方"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "The SRP app that gets an SRP link when a fleet starts and SRP auto create is on."
msgstr "在舰队开队且开启 SRP 自动创建时，用来创建 SRP 链接的 SRP 应用。"

#: forms_config.py models.py
msgid "Ship groups without bridge"
msgstr "无法搭桥的舰船组"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "Ship groups that cannot take a jump bridge. Their mass is not counted as bridgeable."
msgstr "无法使用跳跃桥的舰船组。它们的质量不计入可搭桥质量。"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "Other ship group IDs"
msgstr "其他舰船组 ID"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "Ship group IDs that are not in the list above, separated by commas."
msgstr "不在上面列表中的舰船组 ID，用逗号分隔。"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "Use the default list (11 groups)"
msgstr "使用默认列表（11 个组）"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "Titan, Dreadnought, Freighter, Carrier, Supercarrier, Rorqual, Jump Freighter, Industrial Command Ship, Force Auxiliary, Lancer Dreadnought and Command Carrier. Ticking this replaces the selection."
msgstr "Titan、Dreadnought、Freighter、Carrier、Supercarrier、Rorqual、Jump Freighter、Industrial Command Ship、Force Auxiliary、Lancer Dreadnought 和 Command Carrier。勾选后会替换上面的选择。"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "FC chooses: when ending a fleet that ran long enough for more than 1x, the FC picks the multiplier; fleets that end automatically get 1x until the FC chooses. Automatic: the highest multiplier the fleet's duration allows. Configure the multipliers under PAP multiplier tiers."
msgstr "“结束时由 FC 选择”：结束一支时长足以获得高于 1 倍的舰队时，由 FC 选择倍率；自动结束的舰队在 FC 选定之前按 1 倍计。“按舰队时长自动”：取舰队时长允许的最高倍率。倍率在“PAP 倍率”中配置。"

#: forms_config.py
#, python-format
msgid "Not ship groups: %(ids)s."
msgstr "不是舰船组：%(ids)s。"

#: forms_config.py
#, python-format
msgid "The ship group IDs %(ids)s were saved, but could not be checked without django-eveonline-sde."
msgstr "已保存舰船组 ID %(ids)s，但没有 django-eveonline-sde 就无法核对它们。"

#: forms_config.py
msgid "That is too many ship groups; the list may hold at most 500 characters."
msgstr "舰船组太多：列表最多 500 个字符。"

