msgid "Member alliance IDs"
msgstr "成员联盟 ID"

#: models.py
msgid "Comma-separated alliance IDs. When set, statistics, leaderboards and history only include users whose main character is currently in one of these alliances, and departed members' history can be pruned. Empty = every Alliance Auth user with a main character."
msgstr "用逗号分隔的联盟 ID。设置后，统计、排行榜和历史只包含大号当前在这些联盟之一的用户，并且可以清理已离开成员的历史。留空表示所有设置了大号的 Alliance Auth 用户。"

#: models.py
msgid "Leaderboard places"
msgstr "排行榜名次数"

#: models.py
msgid "Places shown on PAP leaderboards. Members tied on the last place are all shown."
msgstr "PAP 排行榜显示的名次数。并列最后一名的成员全部显示。"

#: models.py
msgid "Leaderboard visibility"
msgstr "排行榜可见范围"

#: models.py
msgid "Who sees the PAP leaderboard. Everyone with FleetOps access sees the alliance board and their own corporation's board; statistics managers see the boards their statistics permission covers."
msgstr "谁能看到 PAP 排行榜。所有有 FleetOps 权限的人都能看到全联盟排行榜和自己军团的排行榜；统计管理者能看到其统计权限所覆盖的排行榜。"

