msgid "SRP provider. 'auto' uses FleetOps SRP when it is enabled, then aa-srp, then Alliance Auth SRP."
msgstr "SRP 提供方。“auto”表示优先使用已启用的 FleetOps SRP，其次是 aa-srp，再其次是 Alliance Auth SRP。"

#: models.py
msgid "SDE ship group IDs that cannot take a jump bridge. Their mass is not counted as bridgeable. Default: Titan, Dreadnought, Freighter, Carrier, Supercarrier, Rorqual, Jump Freighter, Industrial Command Ship, Force Auxiliary, Lancer Dreadnought, Command Carrier."
msgstr "无法使用跳跃桥的 SDE 舰船组 ID。它们的质量不计入可搭桥质量。默认：Titan、Dreadnought、Freighter、Carrier、Supercarrier、Rorqual、Jump Freighter、Industrial Command Ship、Force Auxiliary、Lancer Dreadnought、Command Carrier。"

